From 4af581cbebe5a659141b1d198d9a717307718470 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:13:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] docs: record p1p4 and the CRIU/FHANDLE result

Update the kernel and image lines for boot_272_p1p4.img, mark the CRIU
diag families and FHANDLE as enabled, and record that the ntsync
stress_wait failure comes from the selftest's non-atomic counter being
hoisted out of the loop by the compiler, not from the kernel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 README.gki-docker.md | 31 ++++++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 13 deletions(-)

